    {
      "id": "tt_inline",
      "text": "inline markup (graph-tui)\n**bold** *italic* ~~strike~~ <u>underline</u> <dim>dim</dim>\n<fg=#ff8800>foreground</fg> <bg=#223388>background</bg>\n<fg=#66dd66>nested <u>underline</u></fg> link: [example](https://example.com)\nliteral \\<u> and \\<|new box|>",
      "at": [-106, 79],
      "box": "st_inline",
      "color": null,
      "bg": null,
      "align": "left",
      "layer": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t8_styles",
      "text": "Appendix: every style in one place.\nFrames: single, rounded, double, heavy, point.\nText: **bold**, *italic*, ~~strike~~, colours, fills, align.\nEdges: solid / dashed / dotted, four directions, corners, heads.\nAn ordinary document: break it, :q, then rerun the command.",
      "at": [0, 92],
      "box": "c8_styles",
      "color": null,
      "bg": null,
      "align": "left",
      "layer": ""
    }
